From d966eca4a05ac333b6c1300466e87ce9907d35f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Noam Camus <ncamus@habana.ai>
Date: Fri, 19 Apr 2019 12:21:04 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-0] pll: Gaudi set ALL PLLs

This way we can easily skip PLL init in u-boot.
No need to figure out which PLL is bypassed or not

Change-Id: I8cf4dff275181ecfdfb13eee48939338aac78ba3
---

